'''May Gauntlet II''' (続・5月強襲！, ''Zoku・5 Gatsu Kyōshū！'', '''Continued・May Assault!''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that only appears during May and was added in the [[Version 11.4 Update]]. It features enemies from the [[Lovesick Again (Monthly Event)|Lovesick Again]] event.

==Overview==
===About===
May Gauntlet II contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] stages, called '''Again''' (アゲイン Lvs.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of an Again Lv can include [[Battle Items]], one Platinum Fragment and [[Ototo Corps|Catamins]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[May Gauntlet II/Again Lv.11~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*May Gauntlet II is unlocked after clearing [[Lovesick Again (Monthly Event)|Lovesick Again]].

